    - target: {fileID: 7039160760367902337, guid: 821f93444d8c5134292838c3b966c1ab, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Real treasury paper has a watermark pressed into it. You only see it
        with special UV light. Fakes printed on new paper show nothing. But not all
        documents have a watermark, as you might expect.


        Read the text
        as well. Bogus documents get dates, names or titles wrong. '
