      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Bronze is heavy and bronze is not magnetic. If a magnet sticks, there
        is iron under the paint, quite a cheap material.


        Interestingly,
        the majority of statuettes are in the weight range above 400 g.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
