    - target: {fileID: 7039160760367902337, guid: 821f93444d8c5134292838c3b966c1ab, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Minerals are valued by their peculiarities. Fluorite glows blue-purple
        under UV light. Glass copies stay dark.


        Real crystal is heavy for
        its size. If it feels light, that is not in favor of its authenticity.


        Gemstones
        are not magnetic. If a magnet sticks, it is iron ore, and it is probably
        cheap.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
